# Nothing here is needed to RUN the site. Keeping it out of the deployment
# bundle keeps uploads small and, more importantly, keeps customer data out
# of the build entirely.

# Customer email lists — 800+ real addresses across these batch loaders.
# They are operational SQL, run by hand in Supabase, never by the app.
step*-load-grants*.sql

# Audit evidence and one-off tooling — useful in the repo, dead weight in prod.
docs/
scripts/
*.png
.playwright-mcp/
.claude/

# Local scratch
__pycache__/
*.pyc
